            <p>Costa Cruises has a long history that started in Italy. This history is a part of what makes Costa Cruises special. When you are on a Costa Cruises ship you can see that history in everything. </p>

            <p>For people from America who want to do more than just watch shows and eat at buffets, Costa Cruises is a choice. Costa Cruises gives you something on a trip that is about the local way of life, the local food and taking your time to really enjoy the journey. Costa Cruises is about traveling in a way that means something. </p>

            <p>Costa is different from cruise lines that only care about how big their ships are or how many things they can do on board. Costa thinks that the places you visit and the feeling you get when you are on the ship are really important. They make sure you have plenty of time to see all the things at the ports where you stop. At night it feels fun and fancy on the Costa ship. The Costa ship has an atmosphere. Costa wants you to have a time when you are, on the ship and when you are visiting the destinations. </p>


